<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FMFO Sports — Commentator Analytics Control Room</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg-0:#06060c;--bg-1:#0d0d16;--bg-2:#14141f;--bg-3:#1c1c2b;--bg-4:#232336;--accent:#00e87b;--accent-dim:#00c468;--accent-bg:rgba(0,232,123,.08);--accent-bg2:rgba(0,232,123,.15);--text-1:#eeeef4;--text-2:#9999b0;--text-3:#5a5a72;--border-1:#252538;--border-2:#333348;--red:#ff4466;--orange:#ff9933;--blue:#4488ff;--purple:#a855f7;--gold:#c5a028;--r:10px;--r-lg:14px}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:light){:root:not([data-theme="dark"]){--bg-0:#f4f4f7;--bg-1:#eaeaef;--bg-2:#fff;--bg-3:#f8f8fb;--bg-4:#eee;--text-1:#111;--text-2:#555;--text-3:#999;--border-1:#ddd;--border-2:#ccc}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg-0:#06060c;--bg-1:#0d0d16;--bg-2:#14141f;--bg-3:#1c1c2b;--bg-4:#232336;--text-1:#eeeef4;--text-2:#9999b0;--text-3:#5a5a72;--border-1:#252538;--border-2:#333348}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--bg-0);color:var(--text-1);min-height:100vh;line-height:1.55}
.hdr{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-1);background:var(--bg-1);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.hdr-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.logo{width:34px;height:34px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:800 13px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#000;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.brand-name{font:700 17px/1.2 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.4px}
.brand-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase}
.hdr-tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);font-style:italic}
.mob-tog{display:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border-1);background:var(--bg-2);color:var(--text-2);cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;min-height:calc(100vh - 59px)}
@media(max-width:800px){.shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side{display:none}.side.open{display:flex;position:fixed;inset:59px 0 0 0;z-index:90}.mob-tog{display:flex!important}}
.side{background:var(--bg-1);border-right:1px solid var(--border-1);padding:14px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;overflow-y:auto}
.nav-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:var(--r);border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--text-2);font:500 12px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;width:100%;text-align:left;transition:.12s}
.nav-btn:hover{background:var(--bg-3);color:var(--text-1)}
.nav-btn.on{background:var(--accent-bg2);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.ni{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0}
.sep{height:1px;background:var(--border-1);margin:6px 0}
.stl{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:700;padding:6px 10px 2px}
.pw{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;border-radius:var(--r);background:var(--accent-bg);border:1px solid rgba(0,232,123,.15);color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:auto;transition:.12s}
.pw:hover{background:var(--accent-bg2)}
.main{padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow-y:auto}
.card{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:18px;transition:border-color .15s}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--border-2)}
.ch{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.ct{font:700 15px/1.2 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}
.g2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.g3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.g4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}
@media(max-width:960px){.g2,.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.sc{background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-1)}
.sl{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:3px}
.sv{font:700 24px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}
.ss{font-size:11px;margin-top:3px;font-weight:600}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;background:var(--bg-1);border-radius:var(--r);padding:3px;width:fit-content;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--text-2);font:600 11px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s;white-space:nowrap}
.tab:hover{color:var(--text-1)}
.tab.on{background:var(--bg-2);color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
.tab.pred-on{background:rgba(168,85,247,.15);color:var(--purple)!important}
.ir{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}
.inp{flex:1;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);background:var(--bg-3);color:var(--text-1);font:13px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}
.inp:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}.inp::placeholder{color:var(--text-3)}
.btn{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:var(--r);border:none;font:600 12px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;white-space:nowrap}
.bp{background:var(--accent);color:#000}.bp:hover{background:var(--accent-dim)}.bp:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.bs{background:var(--bg-3);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border-1)}.bs:hover{color:var(--text-1);border-color:var(--border-2)}
.bd{background:transparent;color:var(--red);border:1px solid rgba(255,68,102,.3)}.bd:hover{background:rgba(255,68,102,.08)}
.bsm{padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px}
.qr{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-bottom:8px}
.qp{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--border-1);background:transparent;color:var(--text-2);font:11px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s}
.qp:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-bg)}
.out{min-height:100px;padding:14px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;word-break:break-word}
.out.empty{color:var(--text-3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:12px}
.thk{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;padding:14px}
.dots span{display:inline-block;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:dp 1.2s infinite}
.dots span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s}.dots span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s}
@keyframes dp{0%,80%,100%{opacity:.25;transform:scale(.8)}40%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%}.dg{background:var(--accent)}.dr{background:var(--red)}.dy{background:var(--orange)}
.pb{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:var(--r);background:rgba(168,85,247,.1);border:1px solid rgba(168,85,247,.2);font-size:11px;color:var(--purple);margin-bottom:8px}
.fi{padding:10px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s}
.fi:hover{border-color:var(--border-2)}
.hb{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0}
.hq{font:600 12px/1.3 'Inter',sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.hm{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px}
.pr{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pp{font:600 12px/1.3 'Inter',sans-serif;flex:1;min-width:0}
.pt{font:700 10px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px;letter-spacing:.4px}
.pw2{background:rgba(0,232,123,.15);color:var(--accent)}.pl{background:rgba(255,68,102,.15);color:var(--red)}.ppn{background:rgba(153,153,176,.15);color:var(--text-2)}
.cp{background:var(--bg-3);border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r);padding:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;max-height:180px;overflow-y:auto}
.es{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px 16px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;gap:6px}
.es .big{font-size:28px}
.lb-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1)}
.lb-rank{font:800 16px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;width:28px;text-align:center}
.lb-name{font:600 13px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;flex:1}
.lb-stat{font:700 13px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}
.wl-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);justify-content:space-between}
.team-card{background:var(--bg-3);border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s;text-align:center}
.team-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--bg-4)}
.team-card.active{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent)}
.team-card.active{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent)}
.score-row{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);gap:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s}
.score-row:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.score-team{font:600 12px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;width:36px;text-align:center}
.score-num{font:700 16px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;width:24px;text-align:center}
.score-vs{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);width:12px;text-align:center}
.score-final{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-left:auto;text-transform:uppercase}
.score-live{font-size:9px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-left:auto;text-transform:uppercase}
.score-time{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-2);margin-left:auto}
.wp-bar{height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--border-1);overflow:hidden;margin-top:4px}
.wp-fill{height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.standing-row{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;gap:6px}
.standing-row:nth-child(odd){background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:6px}
.standing-rank{width:18px;text-align:center;font:700 11px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--text-3)}
.standing-team{flex:1;font-weight:600}
.standing-rec{font:600 12px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--text-2)}
.h2h-vs{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;padding:20px;text-align:center}
.h2h-team{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex:1}
.h2h-name{font:700 16px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}
.h2h-badge{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px}
.h2h-divider{font:800 20px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--text-3)}
.share-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg-2),var(--bg-3));border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.share-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--purple))}
.share-card .watermark{position:absolute;bottom:8px;right:12px;font:600 9px 'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:1px}
.game-hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg-2),var(--bg-3));border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:24px;text-align:center}
.game-score-big{font:800 36px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;margin:8px 0}
.game-teams-big{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px}
.game-team-big{font:700 18px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}
.tab-row{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}
.chip{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--border-1);background:transparent;color:var(--text-2);font:600 10px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s}
.chip:hover,.chip.on{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-bg)}
.player-card{background:var(--bg-3);border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s}
.player-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.player-avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg-4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0}
.parlay-slip{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(168,85,247,.06),rgba(0,232,123,.06));border:1px solid rgba(168,85,247,.2);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:16px}
.parlay-pick{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);margin-bottom:6px}
.parlay-pick .remove{margin-left:auto;color:var(--red);cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;font-size:14px}
.trend-item{padding:12px;background:var(--bg-3);border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);cursor:pointer;transition:.12s}
.trend-item:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.trend-rank{font:800 14px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--accent);width:24px}
.trend-fire{font-size:10px;color:var(--orange)}
.prep-section{background:var(--bg-3);border:1px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:var(--r);padding:12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.prep-section .prep-title{font:700 12px/1 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:6px}
.note-area{width:100%;min-height:80px;padding:10px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border-1);background:var(--bg-4);color:var(--text-1);font:13px/1.5 'Inter',sans-serif;resize:vertical;outline:none}
.note-area:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.alert-badge{background:var(--orange);color:#000;font:700 10px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px;margin-left:auto}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px}::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border-1);border-radius:3px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hdr">
  <div class="hdr-left">
    <button class="mob-tog" onclick="document.getElementById('side').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button>
    <div class="logo">FS</div>
    <div class="brand"><div class="brand-name">FMFO Sports</div><div class="brand-sub">Analytics Control Room</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hdr-tag">The Intelligence Behind the Commentary</div>
</div>
<div class="shell">
  <aside class="side" id="side"></aside>
  <main class="main" id="main"></main>
</div>
<script src="api.js"></script>
<script>
const SP=[
  {id:'nfl',name:'NFL Football',icon:'🏈',c:'#013369',teams:['Chiefs','Ravens','49ers','Lions','Bills','Eagles','Cowboys','Dolphins','Bengals','Jets','Packers','Texans','Bears','Steelers','Browns']},
  {id:'nba',name:'NBA Basketball',icon:'🏀',c:'#c9082a',teams:['Celtics','Thunder','Nuggets','Timberwolves','Knicks','Lakers','Warriors','Bucks','Mavericks','Clippers','76ers','Heat','Suns','Cavaliers']},
  {id:'mlb',name:'MLB Baseball',icon:'⚾',c:'#002d72',teams:['Dodgers','Braves','Yankees','Astros','Phillies','Orioles','Rangers','Twins','Guardians','Padres','Rays','Diamondbacks','Mariners','Brewers']},
  {id:'nhl',name:'NHL Hockey',icon:'🏒',c:'#555',teams:['Panthers','Oilers','Stars','Rangers','Avalanche','Bruins','Hurricanes','Canucks','Maple Leafs','Jets','Kings','Wild','Lightning','Predators']},
  {id:'soccer',name:'Soccer',icon:'⚽',c:'#1a8f3c',teams:['Man City','Arsenal','Liverpool','Real Madrid','Barcelona','Bayern Munich','PSG','Inter Milan','Dortmund','Napoli','Chelsea','Juventus','AC Milan']},
  {id:'mma',name:'MMA / Combat',icon:'🥊',c:'#8b0000',teams:['Heavyweight','Light Heavyweight','Middleweight','Welterweight','Lightweight','Featherweight','Bantamweight','Flyweight',"Women's Divisions"]},
  {id:'boxing',name:'Boxing',icon:'🥋',c:'#c5a028',teams:['Heavyweight','Cruiserweight','Light Heavyweight','Super Middleweight','Middleweight','Welterweight','Lightweight','Featherweight','Super Bantamweight']},
];
const MODES=[{id:'pre',label:'Pre-Game Intel',icon:'📋'},{id:'live',label:'Live Analysis',icon:'🔴'},{id:'post',label:'Post-Game Review',icon:'📊'},{id:'pred',label:'Predictions',icon:'🔮'}];
const QP={
  pre:{nfl:['Key matchups to watch','Injury report impact','O vs D rankings','Weather impact'],nba:['Player efficiency trends','B2B fatigue analysis','3pt shooting trends','Rookie impact'],mlb:['Pitcher matchup analysis','Batting hot streaks','Bullpen fatigue risk','Park factors'],nhl:['Goalie save % trends','Power play efficiency','Line combos','Home/away splits'],soccer:['xG leaders analysis','Pressing matchups','Set piece rates','Rotation predictions'],mma:['Tale of the tape','Striking vs grappling','Win streak momentum','Judge tendencies'],boxing:['Reach and tale of tape','Camp/trainer breakdown','Orthodox vs southpaw','Belt implications']},
  live:{nfl:['Momentum shifts','Play-calling trends','Red zone efficiency','Turnover impact'],nba:['Run analysis','Foul trouble impact','Pace comparison','Lineup +/-'],mlb:['Pitch count watch','Situational hitting','Defensive shifts','Bullpen tracker'],nhl:['Shot differential','Zone time','PK performance','Faceoff rates'],soccer:['Possession control','Sub impact','Shape analysis','xG update'],mma:['Round scorecard','Strike analysis','Takedown defense','Cardio tracking'],boxing:['Round scorecard','Punch accuracy','Body work impact','Corner adjustments']},
  post:{nfl:['Turning points','MVP breakdown','Playoff impact','Coaching grade'],nba:['Box score dive','Clutch performance','Season impact','POTG case'],mlb:['Pitching grade','Key at-bats','Series impact','Defense highlights'],nhl:['Shot quality','Special teams grade','Standings impact','Three stars'],soccer:['Player ratings','Tactical summary','Table impact','Manager review'],mma:['Fight scoring','Rankings impact','Bonus worthy','What next'],boxing:['Scorecard review','Punch stats','Division impact','Rematch case']},
  pred:{nfl:['Upset predictions','Over/under analysis','Playoff projections','Bold season picks'],nba:['MVP prediction','Winners with confidence %','Title contenders','Breakout players'],mlb:['Pitching duel outcome','Seed projections','Series predictions','HR pace projection'],nhl:['Tonight\'s outcomes','Cup contenders','Goalie winner','Points pace'],soccer:['Match result %','Title projection','Scorer predictions','Relegation forecast'],mma:['Outcome + method','Underdog upsets','Round prediction','Best parlay'],boxing:['KO, TKO or decision','Round prediction','Underdog breakdown','P4P forecast']}
};

let S={page:'dashboard',sport:'nfl',mode:'pre',team:null,history:[],saved:[],predictions:[],watchlist:[],leaderboard:[],output:'',loading:false,contentDraft:'',alerts:[],liveData:{},h2h:{teamA:'',teamB:'',result:''},gameCtx:null,parlay:[],prepNotes:'',trendCache:''};
let ctl=null,aiReady=false,dbReady=false,myId="default",myName="Analyst",tierInfo=null;

async function boot(){
  render();
  try{
    const h=await FMFO.health();
    aiReady=h.ai;dbReady=true;
    tierInfo=await FMFO.getTier();
    myName=tierInfo?.label||'Analyst';
    await loadAll();
    await loadLive();
  }catch(e){console.log('boot err',e)}
  checkAlerts();
  render();
}

async function loadLive(){
  const ids=['nfl','nba','mlb','nhl','epl'];
  for(const id of ids){
    try{S.liveData[id]=await FMFO.getScores(id)}catch(e){}
  }
}

async function loadAll(){
  try{
    const[a,p,lb]=await Promise.all([
      FMFO.getAnalyses(),
      FMFO.getPredictions(),
      FMFO.getLeaderboard(),
    ]);
    if(a?.length)S.saved=a;
    if(p?.length)S.predictions=p;
    if(lb?.length)S.leaderboard=lb;
  }catch(e){console.log('load err',e)}
}

async function loadLeaderboard(){
  try{S.leaderboard=await FMFO.getLeaderboard()}catch(e){}
}

async function updateMyLeaderboard(){
  try{await loadLeaderboard()}catch(e){}
}

async function dbSave(col,data){try{return await FMFO.post(`/${col}`,data)}catch(e){return null}}
async function dbDel(col,id){if(!id)return;try{await FMFO.del(`/${col}/${id}`)}catch(e){}}
async function dbUp(col,id,data){if(!id)return;try{await FMFO.patch(`/${col}/${id}`,data)}catch(e){}}

function checkAlerts(){
  S.alerts=[];
  const pending=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='pending');
  if(pending.length>=3)S.alerts.push({text:`${pending.length} predictions need results`,action:'predictions'});
  S.watchlist.forEach(w=>{
    const lastAnalysis=S.saved.filter(a=>a.sport===w.sport&&a.query?.toLowerCase().includes(w.team.toLowerCase())).sort((a,b)=>new Date(b.savedAt)-new Date(a.savedAt))[0];
    if(!lastAnalysis)S.alerts.push({text:`${w.team} — no analysis yet`,action:'analyze',sport:w.sport,team:w.team});
  });
}

function render(){renderSide();renderMain()}

function renderSide(){
  const s=document.getElementById('side');
  const alertCount=S.alerts.length;
  s.innerHTML=`
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='dashboard'?'on':''}" onclick="go('dashboard')"><div class="ni">🏠</div>Dashboard${alertCount?`<span class="alert-badge">${alertCount}</span>`:''}</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='scores'?'on':''}" onclick="go('scores')"><div class="ni">📡</div>Live Scores</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='analyze'?'on':''}" onclick="go('analyze')"><div class="ni">⚡</div>Analyze</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='teams'?'on':''}" onclick="go('teams')"><div class="ni">🏟️</div>Team Hub</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='predictions'?'on':''}" onclick="go('predictions')"><div class="ni">🔮</div>Predictions</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='leaderboard'?'on':''}" onclick="go('leaderboard')"><div class="ni">🏆</div>Leaderboard</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='watchlist'?'on':''}" onclick="go('watchlist')"><div class="ni">👁️</div>Watchlist${S.watchlist.length?`<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);margin-left:auto">${S.watchlist.length}</span>`:''}</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='h2h'?'on':''}" onclick="go('h2h')"><div class="ni">⚔️</div>Head-to-Head</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='player'?'on':''}" onclick="go('player')"><div class="ni">🎯</div>Player Spotlight</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='parlay'?'on':''}" onclick="go('parlay')"><div class="ni">🎰</div>Parlay Builder</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='trending'?'on':''}" onclick="go('trending')"><div class="ni">🔥</div>Trending</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='prep'?'on':''}" onclick="go('prep')"><div class="ni">📋</div>Prep Sheet</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='content'?'on':''}" onclick="go('content')"><div class="ni">📝</div>Content</button>
    <button class="nav-btn ${S.page==='library'?'on':''}" onclick="go('library')"><div class="ni">📚</div>Library</button>
    <div class="sep"></div>
    <div class="stl">Sports</div>
    ${SP.map(sp=>`<button class="nav-btn ${S.sport===sp.id&&(S.page==='analyze'||S.page==='teams'||S.page==='scores')?'on':''}" onclick="pickSport('${sp.id}')">
      <div class="ni" style="background:${sp.c}18;font-size:12px">${sp.icon}</div><span style="font-size:11px">${sp.name}</span>
    </button>`).join('')}
    <div class="sep"></div>
    <div class="sc" style="margin:2px 0;padding:8px">
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px">👤 ${esc(myName)}</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-2)">${S.history.length+S.saved.length} analyses · ${S.predictions.length} predictions</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);padding:0 4px">
      <div class="dot ${aiReady?'dg':'dr'}"></div>${aiReady?'AI On':'Off'}
      <div class="dot ${dbReady?'dg':'dy'}" style="margin-left:4px"></div>${dbReady?'Synced':'Local'}
    </div>
    <a href="https://www.formyfansonly.com" target="_blank" class="pw">⚡ formyfansonly.com</a>`;
}

function renderMain(){
  const m=document.getElementById('main');
  const pages={dashboard:renderDashboard,scores:renderScores,analyze:renderAnalyze,teams:renderTeams,predictions:renderPredictions,leaderboard:renderLeaderboard,watchlist:renderWatchlist,h2h:renderH2H,player:renderPlayer,parlay:renderParlay,trending:renderTrending,prep:renderPrep,content:renderContent,library:renderLibrary,gameDetail:renderGameDetail};
  m.innerHTML=(pages[S.page]||renderDashboard)();
  if(S.page==='analyze'){renderOutput();renderStatus()}
}

function renderDashboard(){
  const w=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='win').length,l=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='loss').length,pn=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='pending').length;
  const pct=(w+l)?Math.round(w/(w+l)*100):0;
  const recent=S.history.slice(-5).reverse();
  const sBreak={};S.history.forEach(h=>{sBreak[h.sport]=(sBreak[h.sport]||0)+1});
  const topSp=Object.entries(sBreak).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1])[0];
  return `
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
      <div><div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">Welcome back, ${esc(myName)}</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px">What Are You A Fan Of?</div></div>
      <button class="btn bp" onclick="go('analyze')">⚡ Analyze</button>
    </div>
    ${S.alerts.length?`<div class="card" style="border-color:var(--orange);border-style:dashed">
      <div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--orange)">⚠️ Alerts</div>
      ${S.alerts.map(a=>`<div class="fi" onclick="${a.action==='predictions'?`go('predictions')`:`pickSport('${a.sport}')`}" style="padding:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
        <span style="font-size:12px">${esc(a.text)}</span>
        <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-left:auto">→</span>
      </div>`).join('')}
    </div>`:''}
    <div class="g4">
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Analyses</div><div class="sv">${S.history.length+S.saved.length}</div></div>
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Predictions</div><div class="sv">${S.predictions.length}</div>${pn?`<div class="ss" style="color:var(--orange)">${pn} pending</div>`:''}</div>
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Accuracy</div><div class="sv" style="color:${pct>=60?'var(--accent)':pct>=40?'var(--orange)':'var(--red)'}">${pct?pct+'%':'—'}</div><div class="ss" style="color:var(--text-3)">${w}W–${l}L</div></div>
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Watching</div><div class="sv">${S.watchlist.length}</div><div class="ss" style="color:var(--text-3)">teams</div></div>
    </div>
    ${renderLiveTicker()}
    <div class="g2">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">Watchlist</div><button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="go('watchlist')">Manage</button></div>
        ${S.watchlist.length?S.watchlist.slice(0,5).map(w2=>{const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===w2.sport);return `
          <div class="fi" onclick="analyzeTeam('${w2.sport}','${w2.team.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')" style="padding:6px;margin-bottom:4px">
            <div class="hb" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18;font-size:12px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
            <div style="flex:1"><div class="hq">${esc(w2.team)}</div><div class="hm">${sp?.name}</div></div>
            <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent)">Analyze →</span>
          </div>`}).join(''):`<div class="es"><div class="big">👁️</div><div style="font-size:12px">Add teams to your watchlist</div></div>`}
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">Recent</div><button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="go('library')">All</button></div>
        ${recent.length?recent.map((h,i)=>{const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===h.sport);return `
          <div class="fi" onclick="viewHist(${S.history.length-1-i})" style="padding:6px;margin-bottom:4px">
            <div class="hb" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18;font-size:12px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
            <div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><div class="hq">${esc(h.query)}</div><div class="hm">${h.time}</div></div>
          </div>`}).join(''):`<div class="es"><div class="big">📊</div><div style="font-size:12px">Run your first analysis</div></div>`}
      </div>
    </div>
    ${pn?`<div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ct">⏳ Pending Predictions</div></div>${S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='pending').slice(0,5).map((p,i)=>{const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===p.sport);const idx=S.predictions.indexOf(p);return `
      <div class="pr" style="margin-bottom:4px"><span style="font-size:13px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</span><div class="pp">${esc(p.pick)}</div>
        <button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(0,232,123,.12);color:var(--accent);border:none" onclick="markPred(${idx},'win')">✓</button>
        <button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(255,68,102,.12);color:var(--red);border:none" onclick="markPred(${idx},'loss')">✗</button>
      </div>`}).join('')}</div>`:''}`}

function renderAnalyze(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);const pr=QP[S.mode]?.[S.sport]||[];const ml=MODES.find(m=>m.id===S.mode)?.label||'';
  return `
    <div class="tabs">${MODES.map(m=>`<button class="tab ${S.mode===m.id?(m.id==='pred'?'on pred-on':'on'):''}" onclick="pickMode('${m.id}')">${m.icon} ${m.label}</button>`).join('')}</div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ch">
        <div class="ct">${sp.icon} ${ml} — ${sp.name}${S.team?` · ${S.team}`:''}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          ${S.output&&!S.loading?`<button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="saveAn()">💾</button>${S.mode==='pred'?`<button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.12);color:var(--purple);border:none" onclick="logPred()">🔮 Log</button>`:''}<button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="toContent()">📝</button>`:''}
          ${S.loading?`<button class="btn bd bsm" onclick="stopAn()">⏹ Stop</button>`:''}
        </div>
      </div>
      ${S.mode==='pred'?'<div class="pb">🔮 Predictions are entertainment analysis — not gambling advice.</div>':''}
      <div class="qr">${pr.map(p=>`<button class="qp" onclick="runQP(this.textContent)">${p}</button>`).join('')}</div>
      <div class="ir">
        <input class="inp" id="qi" placeholder="${S.mode==='pred'?'Predict…':'Analyze…'} ${sp.name}${S.team?' · '+S.team:''}…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')runQ()">
        <button class="btn bp" onclick="runQ()" ${S.loading?'disabled':''} ${S.mode==='pred'?'style="background:var(--purple)"':''}>${S.loading?'⏳':S.mode==='pred'?'🔮':'⚡'} ${S.loading?'Working…':S.mode==='pred'?'Predict':'Analyze'}</button>
      </div>
      <div id="ob"></div><div id="sb"></div>
    </div>`}

function renderTeams(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const teamPreds={};S.predictions.filter(p=>p.sport===S.sport).forEach(p=>{const t=p.team||'Other';if(!teamPreds[t])teamPreds[t]={w:0,l:0,p:0};if(p.result==='win')teamPreds[t].w++;else if(p.result==='loss')teamPreds[t].l++;else teamPreds[t].p++});
  const teamAnalyses={};S.saved.filter(a=>a.sport===S.sport).forEach(a=>{(sp.teams||[]).forEach(t=>{if(a.query?.toLowerCase().includes(t.toLowerCase())){if(!teamAnalyses[t])teamAnalyses[t]=0;teamAnalyses[t]++}})});
  const isWatched=t=>S.watchlist.some(w=>w.sport===S.sport&&w.team===t);
  return `
    <div class="ch"><div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">🏟️ ${sp.icon} ${sp.name} — Team Hub</div></div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
      ${(sp.teams||[]).map(t=>`<div class="team-card ${S.team===t?'active':''}" onclick="selectTeam('${t.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">
        <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700">${esc(t)}</div>
        ${teamPreds[t]?`<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px">${teamPreds[t].w}W–${teamPreds[t].l}L</div>`:''}
        ${isWatched(t)?'<div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:2px">👁️ watching</div>':''}
      </div>`).join('')}
    </div>
    ${S.team?`<div class="card">
      <div class="ch"><div class="ct">${sp.icon} ${S.team}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:4px">
          <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="analyzeTeam('${S.sport}','${S.team.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">⚡ Analyze</button>
          ${isWatched(S.team)?`<button class="btn bd bsm" onclick="unwatchTeam('${S.team.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">Remove Watch</button>`:`<button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="watchTeam('${S.team.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">👁️ Watch</button>`}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="g3">
        <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Analyses</div><div class="sv">${teamAnalyses[S.team]||0}</div></div>
        <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Predictions</div><div class="sv">${teamPreds[S.team]?(teamPreds[S.team].w+teamPreds[S.team].l+teamPreds[S.team].p):0}</div></div>
        <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Record</div><div class="sv" style="font-size:18px">${teamPreds[S.team]?`<span style="color:var(--accent)">${teamPreds[S.team].w}W</span>–<span style="color:var(--red)">${teamPreds[S.team].l}L</span>`:'—'}</div></div>
      </div>
      ${S.saved.filter(a=>a.sport===S.sport&&a.query?.toLowerCase().includes(S.team.toLowerCase())).length?`
        <div class="ct" style="margin:12px 0 8px;font-size:13px">Recent Analyses</div>
        ${S.saved.filter(a=>a.sport===S.sport&&a.query?.toLowerCase().includes(S.team.toLowerCase())).slice(-3).reverse().map((a,i)=>`
          <div class="fi" onclick="loadSaved2(${S.saved.indexOf(a)})" style="padding:6px;margin-bottom:4px"><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><div class="hq">${esc(a.query)}</div><div class="hm">${new Date(a.savedAt).toLocaleDateString()}</div></div></div>
        `).join('')}`:''}
    </div>`:''}`}

function renderPredictions(){
  const w=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='win').length,l=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='loss').length,pn=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='pending').length;
  const pct=(w+l)?Math.round(w/(w+l)*100):0;
  const bySport={};S.predictions.forEach(p=>{if(!bySport[p.sport])bySport[p.sport]={w:0,l:0,p:0};if(p.result==='win')bySport[p.sport].w++;else if(p.result==='loss')bySport[p.sport].l++;else bySport[p.sport].p++});
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">🔮 Prediction Tracker</div>
    <div class="g4">
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Total</div><div class="sv">${S.predictions.length}</div></div>
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Accuracy</div><div class="sv" style="color:${pct>=60?'var(--accent)':pct>=40?'var(--orange)':'var(--red)'}">${pct?pct+'%':'—'}</div></div>
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Record</div><div class="sv" style="font-size:18px"><span style="color:var(--accent)">${w}W</span>–<span style="color:var(--red)">${l}L</span></div></div>
      <div class="sc"><div class="sl">Pending</div><div class="sv" style="color:var(--orange)">${pn}</div></div>
    </div>
    ${Object.keys(bySport).length?`<div class="card"><div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:10px">By Sport</div><div class="g3">${Object.entries(bySport).map(([sid,r])=>{const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===sid);const p2=(r.w+r.l)?Math.round(r.w/(r.w+r.l)*100):0;return `<div class="sc" style="text-align:center"><div style="font-size:18px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div><div style="font:700 12px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;margin-top:2px">${sp?.name||sid}</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px">${r.w}W–${r.l}L</div><div style="font:700 16px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:${p2>=60?'var(--accent)':p2>=40?'var(--orange)':'var(--red)'}; margin-top:2px">${p2?p2+'%':'—'}</div></div>`}).join('')}</div></div>`:''}
    <div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ct">All Predictions</div><button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="S.mode='pred';go('analyze')">+ New</button></div>
    ${S.predictions.length?`<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">${[...S.predictions].reverse().map((p,ri)=>{const idx=S.predictions.length-1-ri;const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===p.sport);return `
      <div class="pr"><span style="font-size:13px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</span><div class="pp">${esc(p.pick)}</div><span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text-3)">${p.date||''}</span>
        ${p.result==='pending'?`<button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(0,232,123,.12);color:var(--accent);border:none" onclick="markPred(${idx},'win')">✓</button><button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(255,68,102,.12);color:var(--red);border:none" onclick="markPred(${idx},'loss')">✗</button>`:`<div class="pt ${p.result==='win'?'pw2':'pl'}">${p.result==='win'?'WIN':'LOSS'}</div>`}
        <button class="btn bsm bd" style="padding:2px 5px;font-size:9px" onclick="delPred(${idx})">✕</button>
      </div>`}).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="es"><div class="big">🔮</div><div style="font-size:12px">No predictions yet</div></div>`}</div>`}

function renderLeaderboard(){
  const myW=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='win').length,myL=S.predictions.filter(p=>p.result==='loss').length;
  const myPct=(myW+myL)?Math.round(myW/(myW+myL)*100):0;
  const board=S.leaderboard.length?S.leaderboard:[{name:myName,wins:myW,losses:myL,pct:myPct,total:S.predictions.length}];
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">🏆 Prediction Leaderboard</div>
    <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,232,123,.05),rgba(168,85,247,.05));border-color:var(--accent)">
      <div style="text-align:center;padding:10px 0">
        <div style="font-size:32px">🏆</div>
        <div class="ct" style="font-size:16px;margin-top:4px">${esc(myName)}</div>
        <div style="font:700 32px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px">${myPct?myPct+'%':'—'}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px">${myW}W – ${myL}L · ${S.predictions.length} total predictions</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card"><div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:10px">Rankings</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px">
        ${board.map((e,i)=>`<div class="lb-row">
          <div class="lb-rank" style="color:${i===0?'var(--gold)':i===1?'var(--text-2)':i===2?'var(--orange)':'var(--text-3)'}">${i===0?'🥇':i===1?'🥈':i===2?'🥉':i+1}</div>
          <div class="lb-name">${esc(e.name||'Analyst')}</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3)">${e.wins||0}W–${e.losses||0}L</div>
          <div class="lb-stat" style="color:${(e.pct||0)>=60?'var(--accent)':(e.pct||0)>=40?'var(--orange)':'var(--red)'}">${e.pct||0}%</div>
        </div>`).join('')}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center">Share the app to compete with other FMFO analysts</div>`}

function renderWatchlist(){
  return `
    <div class="ch"><div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">👁️ Watchlist</div><button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="addWatch()">+ Add Team</button></div>
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px">Track teams and get analysis alerts when you open the app.</div>
    ${S.watchlist.length?`<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px">
      ${S.watchlist.map((w,i)=>{const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===w.sport);return `
        <div class="wl-item">
          <div class="hb" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18;font-size:12px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
          <div style="flex:1"><div style="font:600 13px 'Inter',sans-serif">${esc(w.team)}</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3)">${sp?.name}</div></div>
          <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="analyzeTeam('${w.sport}','${w.team.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">⚡</button>
          <button class="btn bd bsm" onclick="removeWatch(${i})">✕</button>
        </div>`}).join('')}
    </div>`:`<div class="es"><div class="big">👁️</div><div style="font-size:12px">Your watchlist is empty. Add teams from the Team Hub or click + above.</div></div>`}
    ${S.watchlist.length?`<div class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="ch"><div class="ct">Morning Brief</div></div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px">Generate a full briefing for all your watched teams.</div>
      <button class="btn bp" onclick="morningBrief()">📋 Generate Watchlist Brief</button>
      <div id="briefOut"></div>
    </div>`:''}`}

function renderContent(){
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">📝 Content Creator</div>
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px">Turn analyses into fan-facing content for FMFO.</div>
    <div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ct">From Saved Analysis</div></div>
      ${S.saved.length?`<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">${S.saved.slice(-6).reverse().map((s,i)=>{const sp=SP.find(x=>x.id===s.sport);return `
        <div class="fi" onclick="genContent(${S.saved.length-1-i})" style="padding:6px"><div class="hb" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18;font-size:12px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><div class="hq">${esc(s.query)}</div></div></div>`}).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="es"><div class="big">📚</div><div style="font-size:12px">Save analyses first</div></div>`}
    </div>
    <div class="card"><div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:8px">Custom Content</div>
      <div class="ir"><input class="inp" id="cq" placeholder="e.g. Hot take thread about tonight's NBA games…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')genCustom()"><button class="btn bp" onclick="genCustom()">⚡</button></div>
      <div id="co"></div>
    </div>
    ${S.contentDraft?`<div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ct">Draft</div><div style="display:flex;gap:4px"><button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyDraft()">📋 Copy</button><button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="S.contentDraft='';render()">Clear</button></div></div>
      <div class="cp">${esc(S.contentDraft)}</div></div>`:''}`}

function renderLibrary(){
  return `
    <div class="ch"><div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">📚 Library</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2)">${S.saved.length} saved · ${S.history.length} session</div></div>
    ${S.saved.length?`<div class="card"><div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:10px">Saved</div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
      ${[...S.saved].reverse().map((s,ri)=>{const idx=S.saved.length-1-ri;const sp=SP.find(x=>x.id===s.sport);return `
        <div class="fi" onclick="loadSaved2(${idx})"><div class="hb" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18;font-size:12px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><div class="hq">${esc(s.query)}</div><div class="hm">${sp?.name} · ${s.savedAt?new Date(s.savedAt).toLocaleDateString():''}</div></div>
        <button class="btn bsm bd" style="padding:2px 5px;font-size:9px" onclick="event.stopPropagation();delSaved(${idx})">✕</button></div>`}).join('')}
    </div></div>`:''}
    ${S.history.length?`<div class="card"><div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:10px">Session</div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
      ${[...S.history].reverse().map((h,ri)=>{const idx=S.history.length-1-ri;const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===h.sport);return `
        <div class="fi" onclick="viewHist(${idx})"><div class="hb" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18;font-size:12px">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><div class="hq">${esc(h.query)}</div><div class="hm">${h.mode} · ${h.time}</div></div></div>`}).join('')}
    </div></div>`:''}`}

function renderOutput(){const b=document.getElementById('ob');if(!b)return;if(S.loading&&!S.output)b.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Generating…</div>`;else if(S.output)b.innerHTML=`<div class="out">${esc(S.output)}</div>`;else b.innerHTML=`<div class="out empty">Select a prompt or ask a question.</div>`}
function renderStatus(){const b=document.getElementById('sb');if(b)b.innerHTML=`<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);padding:3px 0"><div class="dot ${aiReady?'dg':'dr'}"></div>AI ${aiReady?'Online':'Offline'} · <div class="dot ${dbReady?'dg':'dy'}"></div>${dbReady?'Synced':'Local'}</div>`}

// NAV
function go(p){S.page=p;S.output='';render();document.getElementById('side')?.classList.remove('open')}
function pickSport(id){S.sport=id;S.team=null;S.page='analyze';S.output='';render();document.getElementById('side')?.classList.remove('open')}
function pickMode(id){S.mode=id;S.output='';renderMain()}
function selectTeam(t){S.team=S.team===t?null:t;renderMain()}
function analyzeTeam(sport,team){S.sport=sport;S.team=team;S.page='analyze';S.output='';render();setTimeout(()=>{const inp=document.getElementById('qi');if(inp)inp.value=`${team} analysis and outlook`},50)}
function runQP(t){document.getElementById('qi').value=t;runQ()}

// ANALYZE
async function runQ(){
  const inp=document.getElementById('qi');const q=inp?.value?.trim();if(!q||S.loading)return;
  S.loading=true;S.output='';renderMain();if(inp)inp.value=q;
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);const ml=MODES.find(m=>m.id===S.mode)?.label||'';
  if(aiReady){
    ctl=new AbortController();
    const prompt=`You are the FMFO Sports AI Analyst powering the FMFO Sports Commentator Analytics Control Room by FMFO Technologies Inc. (For My Fans Only). Expert-level sports analysis for commentators.\n\nSport: ${sp.name}\nMode: ${ml}\n${S.team?'Team focus: '+S.team+'\n':''}Date: ${new Date().toLocaleDateString()}\n\nGuidelines:\n- Lead with the most impactful insight\n- Use specific stats and historical context\n- Provide narrative angles for broadcast\n- Format with clear sections\n${S.mode==='pre'?'- Focus: matchups, trends, storylines, stats for on-air':''}${S.mode==='live'?'- Focus: momentum, adjustments, what to watch':''}${S.mode==='post'?'- Focus: narrative recap, what happened and why':''}${S.mode==='pred'?'- Focus: PREDICTIONS — bold data-backed picks\n- Each prediction: pick, confidence %, 2-3 data points, one risk\n- Be decisive, commit to picks\n- Include LOCK OF THE DAY and SLEEPER PICK\n- Label as entertainment, not gambling advice':''}\n\nEnd with:\n${S.mode==='pred'?'🔮 PREDICTION CONFIDENCE SUMMARY: picks with %\n📌 COMMENTATOR TALKING POINT':'📌 COMMENTATOR TALKING POINT: punchy angle for on-air'}\n\nAnalyze: ${q}`;
    try{const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis(prompt,{signal:ctl.signal,onText:({text})=>{S.output=text;const b=document.getElementById('ob');if(b)b.innerHTML=`<div class="out">${esc(text)}</div>`}});S.output=r.text}catch(e){if(e.code==='cancelled')S.output=S.output||'(Stopped)';else if(e.code==='not_granted'){S.output='⚠️ Allow AI when prompted.';aiReady=false}else if(e.code==='rate_limited')S.output=(e.text||'')+'\n\n⚠️ Rate limited.';else S.output=(e.text||'')+`\n\n⚠️ ${e.message||'Failed.'}`}
  }else{S.output=`━━━ FMFO SPORTS ━━━\n${sp.icon} ${sp.name}${S.team?' · '+S.team:''} — ${ml}\n\nQuery: "${q}"\n\n⚠️ AI offline. Server is starting up — try again in a moment.\n\n— formyfansonly.com`}
  S.loading=false;ctl=null;S.history.push({query:q,sport:S.sport,team:S.team,mode:ml,time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:S.output});
  renderMain();if(inp)inp.value=q;renderSide()}
function stopAn(){if(ctl)ctl.abort()}

// SAVE
async function saveAn(){
  const q=S.history[S.history.length-1]?.query||'Analysis';
  const entry={query:q,sport:S.sport,team:S.team,tab:S.mode,output:S.output,savedAt:new Date().toISOString()};
  S.saved.push(entry);const ref=await dbSave('analyses',entry);if(ref)S.saved[S.saved.length-1]._id=ref.id;render()}
function loadSaved2(i){const s=S.saved[i];if(!s)return;S.sport=s.sport||S.sport;S.mode=s.tab||S.mode;S.team=s.team||null;S.output=s.output||'';S.page='analyze';render()}
async function delSaved(i){const it=S.saved.splice(i,1)[0];if(it?._id)await dbDel('analyses',it._id);render()}
function viewHist(i){const h=S.history[i];if(!h)return;S.sport=h.sport;S.team=h.team||null;S.mode=h.mode==='Pre-Game Intel'?'pre':h.mode==='Live Analysis'?'live':h.mode==='Post-Game Review'?'post':h.mode==='Predictions'?'pred':'pre';S.output=h.output;S.page='analyze';render()}

// PREDICTIONS
function logPred(){const pick=prompt('Enter your prediction pick:');if(!pick)return;const entry={pick,sport:S.sport,team:S.team,date:new Date().toLocaleDateString(),result:'pending'};S.predictions.push(entry);dbSave('predictions',entry).then(r=>{if(r)S.predictions[S.predictions.length-1]._id=r.id;updateMyLeaderboard()});render()}
async function markPred(i,result){S.predictions[i].result=result;if(S.predictions[i]._id)await dbUp('predictions',S.predictions[i]._id,{result});updateMyLeaderboard();render()}
async function delPred(i){const it=S.predictions.splice(i,1)[0];if(it?._id)await dbDel('predictions',it._id);updateMyLeaderboard();render()}

// WATCHLIST
function addWatch(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const teams=sp?.teams||[];if(!teams.length){alert('Select a sport with teams first');return}
  const team=prompt(`Add a ${sp.name} team to your watchlist:\n\n${teams.join(', ')}`);
  if(!team)return;
  if(S.watchlist.some(w=>w.sport===S.sport&&w.team.toLowerCase()===team.toLowerCase()))return;
  const entry={sport:S.sport,team};S.watchlist.push(entry);dbSave('watchlist',entry).then(r=>{if(r)S.watchlist[S.watchlist.length-1]._id=r.id});checkAlerts();render()}
function watchTeam(t){
  if(S.watchlist.some(w=>w.sport===S.sport&&w.team===t))return;
  const entry={sport:S.sport,team:t};S.watchlist.push(entry);dbSave('watchlist',entry).then(r=>{if(r)S.watchlist[S.watchlist.length-1]._id=r.id});checkAlerts();render()}
async function unwatchTeam(t){const i=S.watchlist.findIndex(w=>w.sport===S.sport&&w.team===t);if(i<0)return;const it=S.watchlist.splice(i,1)[0];if(it?._id)await dbDel('watchlist',it._id);checkAlerts();render()}
async function removeWatch(i){const it=S.watchlist.splice(i,1)[0];if(it?._id)await dbDel('watchlist',it._id);checkAlerts();render()}

async function morningBrief(){
  if(!aiReady||!S.watchlist.length)return;
  const out=document.getElementById('briefOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk" style="margin-top:8px"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Generating brief…</div>`;
  const teams=S.watchlist.map(w=>{const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===w.sport);return `${sp?.icon} ${w.team} (${sp?.name})`}).join('\n');
  try{const briefText=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:'Morning briefing for: '+teams,sport:'nfl',mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="margin-top:8px">${esc(text)}</div>`})}catch(e){if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div style="color:var(--red);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">Failed: ${e.message||'try again'}</div>`}}

// CONTENT
function toContent(){if(!S.output)return;S.contentDraft='';S.page='content';render();genContentText(S.output)}
async function genContent(i){const s=S.saved[i];if(!s)return;genContentText(s.output)}
async function genContentText(text){
  if(!aiReady){S.contentDraft=`📢 FMFO SPORTS INSIDER\n\n${text.substring(0,500)}…\n\n🔗 formyfansonly.com\n#FMFOSports #WhatAreYouAFanOf`;render();return}
  S.contentDraft='Generating…';render();
  try{const cRes=await FMFO.generateContent(text.substring(0,3000));S.contentDraft=cRes.content||cRes}catch(e){S.contentDraft=`📢 FMFO SPORTS\n\n${text.substring(0,400)}…\n\n🔗 formyfansonly.com\n#WhatAreYouAFanOf`}
  render()}
async function genCustom(){const inp=document.getElementById('cq');const q=inp?.value?.trim();if(!q||!aiReady)return;const out=document.getElementById('co');if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Generating…</div>`;
  try{const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:`FMFO Sports content writer for formyfansonly.com. Create engaging fan sports content. End with "What Are You A Fan Of?" Under 280 words.\n\nRequest: ${q}`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="cp">${esc(text)}</div>`}});if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="cp">${esc(r.text)}</div><div style="margin-top:6px"><button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyDraft()">📋 Copy</button></div>`}catch(e){if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div style="color:var(--red);font-size:12px">Failed.</div>`}}
function copyDraft(){if(S.contentDraft)navigator.clipboard?.writeText(S.contentDraft).then(()=>{const b=event?.target;if(b){b.textContent='✓ Copied';setTimeout(()=>b.textContent='📋 Copy',1200)}})}

function renderLiveTicker(){
  const keys=Object.keys(S.liveData);
  if(!keys.length)return '';
  let games=[];
  keys.forEach(k=>{
    const d=S.liveData[k];const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===k);
    if(d.upcoming)d.upcoming.slice(0,3).forEach(g=>games.push({...g,sport:k,icon:sp?.icon||'📊',type:'upcoming'}));
    if(d.recent)d.recent.slice(-3).forEach(g=>games.push({...g,sport:k,icon:sp?.icon||'📊',type:'recent'}));
  });
  if(!games.length)return '';
  return `<div class="card">
    <div class="ch"><div class="ct">📡 Live Scoreboard</div><button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="go('scores')">View All</button></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px">
      ${games.slice(0,8).map(g=>{
        if(g.type==='recent'){
          const winner=g.hs>g.as?'home':'away';
          return `<div class="sc" style="min-width:140px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px" onclick="analyzeGame('${g.sport}','${g.away} at ${g.home}')">
            <div style="font-size:10px;margin-bottom:4px">${g.icon}</div>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <span style="font:${winner==='away'?'700':'500'} 11px 'Inter',sans-serif">${g.away}</span>
              <span style="font:700 13px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif">${g.as}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <span style="font:${winner==='home'?'700':'500'} 11px 'Inter',sans-serif">${g.home}</span>
              <span style="font:700 13px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif">${g.hs}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:8px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:3px;text-align:center">${g.note||'FINAL'}</div>
          </div>`
        }else{
          return `<div class="sc" style="min-width:140px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;border-color:rgba(0,232,123,.2)" onclick="analyzeGame('${g.sport}','${g.away} at ${g.home}')">
            <div style="font-size:10px;margin-bottom:4px">${g.icon} <span style="font-size:8px;color:var(--accent)">UPCOMING</span></div>
            <div style="font:600 11px 'Inter',sans-serif">${g.away}</div>
            <div style="font:500 10px/1 'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--text-3);margin:2px 0">at</div>
            <div style="font:600 11px 'Inter',sans-serif">${g.home}</div>
            <div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px">${g.time||''}</div>
            ${g.wp?`<div class="wp-bar"><div class="wp-fill" style="width:${typeof g.wp==='object'?Math.max(...Object.values(g.wp)):50}%"></div></div>`:''}
          </div>`
        }
      }).join('')}
    </div>
  </div>`}

function renderScores(){
  const sportTabs=['nfl','nba','mlb','nhl','soccer'];
  const activeSport=sportTabs.includes(S.sport)?S.sport:'nfl';
  const d=S.liveData[activeSport];
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===activeSport);

  return `
    <div class="ch"><div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">📡 Live Scores & Standings</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3)">${d?.updatedAt?'Updated: '+new Date(d.updatedAt).toLocaleString():''}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs">
      ${sportTabs.map(sid=>{const s2=SP.find(s=>s.id===sid);const hasData=!!S.liveData[sid];return `<button class="tab ${activeSport===sid?'on':''}" onclick="S.sport='${sid}';renderMain()">${s2?.icon} ${s2?.name}${hasData?'':' ⏳'}</button>`}).join('')}
    </div>
    ${d?`
      ${d.champion?`<div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,232,123,.06),rgba(197,160,40,.06));border-color:var(--gold)">
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:8px 0">
          <div style="font-size:28px">🏆</div>
          <div style="font:700 14px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--gold);margin-top:4px">${d.champion}</div>
          ${d.season?`<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:4px">${d.season}</div>`:''}
        </div>
        ${d.playoffs?`<div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          ${d.playoffs.map(p=>`<div class="sc" style="padding:8px;min-width:120px;text-align:center">
            <div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:3px">${p.r}</div>
            <div style="font:600 11px 'Inter',sans-serif">${p.s}</div>
          </div>`).join('')}
        </div>`:''}
      </div>`:''}
      ${d.upcoming?.length?`<div class="card">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">${sp?.icon} Upcoming Games</div>${d.week?`<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">${d.week}</div>`:''}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
          ${d.upcoming.map(g=>`<div class="score-row" onclick="analyzeGame('${activeSport}','${g.away} vs ${g.home}')">
            <div class="score-team" style="font-weight:600">${g.away}</div>
            <div class="score-vs">@</div>
            <div class="score-team" style="font-weight:600">${g.home}</div>
            <div class="score-time">${g.time||''}${g.note?' · <span style="color:var(--accent)">'+g.note+'</span>':''}</div>
            ${g.wp?`<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-left:4px">${typeof g.wp==='object'?Object.entries(g.wp).map(([k,v])=>k+' '+v+'%').join(' / '):g.wp}</div>`:''}
          </div>`).join('')}
        </div>
      </div>`:''}
      ${d.recent?.length?`<div class="card">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">${sp?.icon} Recent Results</div></div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
          ${[...d.recent].reverse().slice(0,12).map(g=>{const aw=g.as>g.hs;const hw=g.hs>g.as;return `<div class="score-row" onclick="analyzeGame('${activeSport}','${g.away} ${g.as} - ${g.hs} ${g.home}')">
            <div class="score-team" style="font-weight:${aw?'700':'400'};color:${aw?'var(--text-1)':'var(--text-3)'}">${g.away}</div>
            <div class="score-num" style="color:${aw?'var(--accent)':'var(--text-2)'}">${g.as}</div>
            <div class="score-vs">–</div>
            <div class="score-num" style="color:${hw?'var(--accent)':'var(--text-2)'}">${g.hs}</div>
            <div class="score-team" style="font-weight:${hw?'700':'400'};color:${hw?'var(--text-1)':'var(--text-3)'}">${g.home}</div>
            <div class="score-final">${g.note||'Final'}</div>
          </div>`}).join('')}
        </div>
      </div>`:''}
      ${d.standings?.length?`<div class="card">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">${sp?.icon} Standings</div></div>
        ${renderStandings(d.standings)}
      </div>`:''}
    `:`<div class="card"><div class="es"><div class="big">📡</div><div style="font-size:12px">No live data available for ${sp?.name} yet. Data loads when the season is active.</div></div></div>`}`}

function renderStandings(standings){
  const divs={};standings.forEach(s=>{if(!divs[s.d])divs[s.d]=[];divs[s.d].push(s)});
  return `<div class="g2">${Object.entries(divs).sort((a,b)=>a[0].localeCompare(b[0])).map(([div,teams])=>`
    <div>
      <div style="font:600 11px 'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:4px;padding:0 8px">${div}</div>
      ${teams.sort((a,b)=>b.w-a.w||(a.l-b.l)).map((t,i)=>`<div class="standing-row">
        <div class="standing-rank">${i+1}</div>
        <div class="standing-team">${t.t}</div>
        <div class="standing-rec">${t.w}-${t.l}</div>
      </div>`).join('')}
    </div>`).join('')}</div>`}

function analyzeGame(sport,matchup){
  // Parse matchup string to extract teams and scores
  const parts=matchup.split(/\s+(?:vs|at|-)\s+/i);
  if(parts.length>=2){
    const awayParts=parts[0].trim().split(/\s+/);
    const homeParts=parts[1].trim().split(/\s+/);
    const away=awayParts[0];const as=awayParts[1]||0;
    const home=homeParts[homeParts.length-1]||homeParts[0];const hs=homeParts.length>1?homeParts[0]:0;
    const hasScore=parseInt(as)>0||parseInt(hs)>0;
    openGame(sport,away,home,hasScore?as:0,hasScore?hs:0,hasScore?'final':'upcoming','','');
    return;
  }
  S.sport=sport;S.page='analyze';S.mode='pre';S.output='';
  render();
  setTimeout(()=>{const inp=document.getElementById('qi');if(inp){inp.value=matchup+' — full breakdown';runQ()}},100)}

// ============ HEAD-TO-HEAD ============
function renderH2H(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const teams=sp?.teams||[];
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">⚔️ Head-to-Head Matchup</div>
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px">Compare any two teams or fighters with AI-powered breakdown.</div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="tab-row">${SP.map(s=>`<button class="chip ${S.sport===s.id?'on':''}" onclick="S.sport='${s.id}';S.h2h={teamA:'',teamB:'',result:''};render()">${s.icon} ${s.name}</button>`).join('')}</div>
      <div class="h2h-vs">
        <div class="h2h-team">
          <div class="h2h-badge" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
          <select class="inp" style="text-align:center;max-width:160px" onchange="S.h2h.teamA=this.value;render()">
            <option value="">Select Team</option>
            ${teams.map(t=>`<option value="${t}" ${S.h2h.teamA===t?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="h2h-divider">VS</div>
        <div class="h2h-team">
          <div class="h2h-badge" style="background:${sp?.c||'#333'}18">${sp?.icon||'📊'}</div>
          <select class="inp" style="text-align:center;max-width:160px" onchange="S.h2h.teamB=this.value;render()">
            <option value="">Select Team</option>
            ${teams.map(t=>`<option value="${t}" ${S.h2h.teamB===t?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      ${S.h2h.teamA&&S.h2h.teamB?`
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px">
          <button class="btn bp" onclick="runH2H('full')">⚡ Full Breakdown</button>
          <button class="btn bs" onclick="runH2H('stats')">📊 Stat Comparison</button>
          <button class="btn bs" onclick="runH2H('history')">📚 History</button>
          <button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.12);color:var(--purple);border:none" onclick="runH2H('predict')">🔮 Predict Winner</button>
        </div>
      `:`<div style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:8px">Select two teams above to compare</div>`}
      <div id="h2hOut"></div>
    </div>
    ${S.h2h.result?`
      <div class="share-card">
        <div style="font:700 12px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:4px">${sp?.icon} ${sp?.name} HEAD-TO-HEAD</div>
        <div style="font:800 16px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;margin-bottom:8px">${esc(S.h2h.teamA)} vs ${esc(S.h2h.teamB)}</div>
        <div class="out" style="font-size:12px;max-height:300px;overflow-y:auto">${esc(S.h2h.result)}</div>
        <div class="watermark">FMFO SPORTS · formyfansonly.com</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:10px">
          <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.h2h.result)">📋 Copy</button>
          <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.h2h.result)">📝 Create Post</button>
          <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="saveH2H()">💾 Save</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    `:''}`}

async function runH2H(type){
  if(!S.h2h.teamA||!S.h2h.teamB)return;
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const out=document.getElementById('h2hOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Analyzing matchup…</div>`;

  const prompts={
    full:`Complete head-to-head breakdown of ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB} in ${sp.name}. Cover recent form, key matchups, statistical edges, historical results, and give your verdict on who has the advantage and why.`,
    stats:`Statistical comparison: ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB} (${sp.name}). Compare key metrics side-by-side — offense, defense, special teams/set pieces, and any standout individual matchups.`,
    history:`Historical rivalry analysis: ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB} in ${sp.name}. Head-to-head record, memorable matchups, turning points in the rivalry, and current trajectory.`,
    predict:`Predict the outcome: ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB} (${sp.name}). Give a definitive pick with confidence %, the predicted score/result, three reasons why, and the key factor that decides it.`
  };

  const query=prompts[type]||prompts.full;
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:`${sp.name} expert analysis.\n\n${query}\n\nEnd with:\n📌 COMMENTATOR TALKING POINT`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{S.h2h.result=text;if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      S.h2h.result=r.text;
    }catch(e){S.h2h.result=`Analysis error: ${e.message||'try again'}`;}
  }else{
    S.h2h.result=`⚔️ ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB}\n\n⚠️ AI offline. Server is starting up — try again.\n\n— FMFO Sports · formyfansonly.com`;
  }
  S.history.push({query:`H2H: ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB}`,sport:S.sport,mode:'Head-to-Head',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:S.h2h.result});
  render();
}

function saveH2H(){
  if(!S.h2h.result)return;
  const entry={query:`H2H: ${S.h2h.teamA} vs ${S.h2h.teamB}`,sport:S.sport,tab:'h2h',output:S.h2h.result,savedAt:new Date().toISOString()};
  S.saved.push(entry);dbSave('analyses',entry).then(r=>{if(r)S.saved[S.saved.length-1]._id=r.id});render();
}

// ============ GAME DETAIL ============
function renderGameDetail(){
  const g=S.gameCtx;
  if(!g)return `<div class="card"><div class="es"><div class="big">🏟️</div><div>No game selected. Click a game from Live Scores.</div></div></div>`;
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===g.sport);
  const isFinal=g.status==='final'||g.status==='recent';
  return `
    <div class="game-hero">
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:8px">${sp?.icon} ${sp?.name?.toUpperCase()}${g.note?' · '+g.note:''}</div>
      <div class="game-teams-big">
        <div class="game-team-big" style="color:${!isFinal||g.as>g.hs?'var(--text-1)':'var(--text-3)'}">${g.away}</div>
        ${isFinal?`
          <div class="game-score-big"><span style="color:${g.as>g.hs?'var(--accent)':'var(--text-2)'}">${g.as}</span> <span style="color:var(--text-3)">—</span> <span style="color:${g.hs>g.as?'var(--accent)':'var(--text-2)'}">${g.hs}</span></div>
        `:`<div class="game-score-big" style="color:var(--text-3)">vs</div>`}
        <div class="game-team-big" style="color:${!isFinal||g.hs>g.as?'var(--text-1)':'var(--text-3)'}">${g.home}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:4px">${isFinal?'FINAL':'UPCOMING'}${g.time?' · '+g.time:''}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:10px">Quick Analysis</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px">
        <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="gameAnalysis('full')">⚡ Full Breakdown</button>
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="gameAnalysis('key')">🔑 Key Matchups</button>
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="gameAnalysis('narrative')">📖 Storylines</button>
        <button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.12);color:var(--purple);border:none" onclick="gameAnalysis('predict')">🔮 Predict</button>
        ${isFinal?`<button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="gameAnalysis('grade')">📊 Grade</button>`:``}
      </div>
      <div id="gameOut"></div>
    </div>`}

async function gameAnalysis(type){
  const g=S.gameCtx;if(!g)return;
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===g.sport);
  const out=document.getElementById('gameOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Analyzing…</div>`;
  const isFinal=g.status==='final'||g.status==='recent';
  const context=isFinal?`${g.away} ${g.as} - ${g.hs} ${g.home} (Final)`:`${g.away} at ${g.home} (Upcoming${g.time?' — '+g.time:''})`;
  const prompts={
    full:`Complete ${isFinal?'post-game':'pre-game'} breakdown: ${context}`,
    key:`Key matchups and factors to watch: ${context}`,
    narrative:`Top storylines and narrative angles for broadcast: ${context}`,
    predict:`Bold prediction with confidence %: ${context}`,
    grade:`Grade both teams' performance and coaching decisions: ${context}`,
  };
  const query=prompts[type]||prompts.full;
  let result='';
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:`${sp.name} analysis.\n\n${query}\n\nEnd with: 📌 COMMENTATOR TALKING POINT`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{result=text;if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      result=r.text;
    }catch(e){result=`Error: ${e.message||'try again'}`;}
  }else{result=`⚠️ AI offline.\n${context}\n— FMFO Sports`;}
  S.history.push({query:`Game: ${context}`,sport:g.sport,mode:isFinal?'Post-Game Review':'Pre-Game Intel',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:result});
  S.output=result;
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(result)}</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
      <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.output)">📋 Copy</button>
      <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.output)">📝 Post</button>
      <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="saveGameAnalysis('${esc(context)}')">💾 Save</button>
    </div>`;
  renderSide();
}

function saveGameAnalysis(ctx){
  const entry={query:`Game: ${ctx}`,sport:S.gameCtx?.sport||S.sport,tab:'game',output:S.output,savedAt:new Date().toISOString()};
  S.saved.push(entry);dbSave('analyses',entry).then(r=>{if(r)S.saved[S.saved.length-1]._id=r.id});
}

function openGame(sport,away,home,as,hs,status,note,time){
  S.gameCtx={sport,away,home,as:parseInt(as)||0,hs:parseInt(hs)||0,status,note:note||'',time:time||''};
  S.page='gameDetail';render();
}

// ============ SHARE HELPERS ============
function copyText(text){
  const clean=typeof text==='string'?text:S.output||'';
  navigator.clipboard?.writeText(clean).then(()=>{
    const b=event?.target;if(b){const orig=b.textContent;b.textContent='✓ Copied';setTimeout(()=>b.textContent=orig,1200);}
  });
}

function shareAsContent(text){
  S.contentDraft='';S.page='content';render();
  genContentText(typeof text==='string'?text:S.output||'');
}

// ============ PLAYER SPOTLIGHT ============
function renderPlayer(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">🎯 Player Spotlight</div>
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px">Deep-dive analysis on any player across any sport.</div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="tab-row">${SP.map(s=>`<button class="chip ${S.sport===s.id?'on':''}" onclick="S.sport='${s.id}';render()">${s.icon}</button>`).join('')}</div>
      <div class="ir">
        <input class="inp" id="playerQ" placeholder="Enter a player name — e.g. Patrick Mahomes, Lionel Messi, Canelo…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')runPlayerSearch()">
        <button class="btn bp" onclick="runPlayerSearch()">🎯 Analyze</button>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px">
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="runPlayerType('scouting')">📋 Scouting Report</button>
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="runPlayerType('stats')">📊 Season Stats</button>
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="runPlayerType('narrative')">📖 Story Arc</button>
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="runPlayerType('compare')">⚔️ Comp Search</button>
        <button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.12);color:var(--purple);border:none" onclick="runPlayerType('mvp')">🏆 Award Case</button>
      </div>
      <div id="playerOut"></div>
    </div>`}

async function runPlayerSearch(){
  const inp=document.getElementById('playerQ');
  const name=inp?.value?.trim();if(!name)return;
  runPlayerAnalysis(name,'full');
}
function runPlayerType(type){
  const inp=document.getElementById('playerQ');
  const name=inp?.value?.trim();if(!name){alert('Enter a player name first');return;}
  runPlayerAnalysis(name,type);
}
async function runPlayerAnalysis(name,type){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const out=document.getElementById('playerOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Scouting ${esc(name)}…</div>`;
  const prompts={
    full:`Complete player spotlight on ${name} (${sp.name}). Current form, key stats, role on their team, strengths and weaknesses, and what makes them must-watch for broadcast.`,
    scouting:`Professional scouting report on ${name} (${sp.name}). Physical tools, technique, tendencies, strengths, weaknesses, and overall grade.`,
    stats:`Current season statistical breakdown for ${name} (${sp.name}). Key numbers, how they rank among peers, trends, and what the numbers tell us.`,
    narrative:`The story of ${name}'s season so far (${sp.name}). Narrative arc, key moments, what's at stake, and the storyline commentators should be telling.`,
    compare:`Historical player comparison for ${name} (${sp.name}). Who is their closest comparison from the past? Break down the similarities, differences, and what it means for their trajectory.`,
    mvp:`Award case for ${name} (${sp.name}). Make the case for why they should win their sport's top individual award. Stats, impact, narrative, and how they stack up against competitors.`
  };
  let result='';
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:`${sp.name} player analysis.\n\n${prompts[type]||prompts.full}\n\nEnd with: 📌 COMMENTATOR TALKING POINT about this player.`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{result=text;if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      result=r.text;
    }catch(e){result=`Error: ${e.message||'try again'}`;}
  }else{result=`🎯 ${name} — ${sp.name}\n\n⚠️ AI offline.\n— FMFO Sports`;}
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(result)}</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
      <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText('${result.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">📋 Copy</button>
      <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="S.output='${result.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}';shareAsContent(S.output)">📝 Post</button>
    </div>`;
  S.output=result;
  S.history.push({query:`Player: ${name}`,sport:S.sport,mode:'Player Spotlight',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:result});
  renderSide();
}

// ============ PARLAY BUILDER ============
function renderParlay(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const totalLegs=S.parlay.length;
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">🎰 Parlay Builder</div>
    <div class="pb">🔮 Entertainment analysis tool — not gambling advice.</div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="tab-row">${SP.map(s=>`<button class="chip ${S.sport===s.id?'on':''}" onclick="S.sport='${s.id}';render()">${s.icon}</button>`).join('')}</div>
      <div class="ir">
        <input class="inp" id="parlayPick" placeholder="Add a pick — e.g. Chiefs ML, Over 45.5, Mahomes 300+ yards…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')addParlayLeg()">
        <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="addParlayLeg()">+ Add</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="parlay-slip">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px">
        <div style="font:700 14px 'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--purple)">🎰 Your Parlay — ${totalLegs} Leg${totalLegs!==1?'s':''}</div>
        ${totalLegs?`<button class="btn bd bsm" onclick="S.parlay=[];render()">Clear All</button>`:''}
      </div>
      ${totalLegs?`
        ${S.parlay.map((p,i)=>`<div class="parlay-pick">
          <span style="font-size:12px">${SP.find(s=>s.id===p.sport)?.icon||'📊'}</span>
          <span style="font:600 12px 'Inter',sans-serif">${esc(p.pick)}</span>
          <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3)">${SP.find(s=>s.id===p.sport)?.name||''}</span>
          <button class="remove" onclick="S.parlay.splice(${i},1);render()">✕</button>
        </div>`).join('')}
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:10px">
          <button class="btn bp" onclick="analyzeParlayAll()">⚡ Analyze Full Parlay</button>
          <button class="btn bs" onclick="analyzeParlayRisk()">⚠️ Risk Assessment</button>
          <button class="btn bsm" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.12);color:var(--purple);border:none" onclick="analyzeParlayAlt()">🔄 Suggest Alternatives</button>
        </div>
      `:`<div class="es" style="padding:16px"><div class="big">🎰</div><div style="font-size:12px">Add picks above to build your parlay. Mix sports for cross-sport parlays.</div></div>`}
      <div id="parlayOut" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
    </div>`}

function addParlayLeg(){
  const inp=document.getElementById('parlayPick');
  const pick=inp?.value?.trim();if(!pick)return;
  S.parlay.push({pick,sport:S.sport});
  inp.value='';render();
}

async function analyzeParlayAll(){await runParlayAnalysis('full');}
async function analyzeParlayRisk(){await runParlayAnalysis('risk');}
async function analyzeParlayAlt(){await runParlayAnalysis('alt');}

async function runParlayAnalysis(type){
  if(!S.parlay.length)return;
  const out=document.getElementById('parlayOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Analyzing parlay…</div>`;
  const legs=S.parlay.map((p,i)=>`Leg ${i+1}: ${p.pick} (${SP.find(s=>s.id===p.sport)?.name||p.sport})`).join('\n');
  const prompts={
    full:`Analyze this ${S.parlay.length}-leg parlay:\n\n${legs}\n\nFor each leg: confidence %, key factor, and risk.\nOverall: combined confidence, best leg, weakest leg, and your verdict.\nEnd with a bold call: RIDE IT or FADE IT.`,
    risk:`Risk assessment for this parlay:\n\n${legs}\n\nIdentify the weakest link, correlation risks (legs that depend on each other), and the single biggest threat to this ticket hitting. Rate overall risk: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH / DANGER.`,
    alt:`This parlay needs improvement:\n\n${legs}\n\nFor any leg below 50% confidence, suggest a stronger alternative pick in the same sport. Keep the strong legs, upgrade the weak ones. Show the improved parlay at the end.`
  };
  let result='';
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis(`FMFO Sports AI Analyst — Parlay Analysis. Entertainment only, not gambling advice.\n\n${prompts[type]||prompts.full}\n\n📌 COMMENTATOR TALKING POINT`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{result=text;if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      result=r.text;
    }catch(e){result=`Error: ${e.message}`;}
  }else{result=`🎰 Parlay: ${S.parlay.length} legs\n⚠️ AI offline.\n— FMFO Sports`;}
  S.output=result;
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(result)}</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
      <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.output)">📋 Copy</button>
      <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.output)">📝 Post</button>
      <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="logParlayPrediction()">🔮 Log All Picks</button>
    </div>`;
  S.history.push({query:`Parlay: ${S.parlay.length} legs`,sport:'multi',mode:'Parlay Builder',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:result});
  renderSide();
}

function logParlayPrediction(){
  S.parlay.forEach(p=>{
    const entry={pick:p.pick,sport:p.sport,date:new Date().toLocaleDateString(),result:'pending'};
    S.predictions.push(entry);
    dbSave('predictions',entry).then(r=>{if(r)S.predictions[S.predictions.length-1]._id=r.id});
  });
  updateMyLeaderboard();render();
}

// ============ TRENDING ============
function renderTrending(){
  return `
    <div class="ch"><div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">🔥 Trending in Sports</div>
      <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="generateTrending()">🔄 Refresh</button>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px">AI-generated hot takes and trending storylines across all sports.</div>
    <div id="trendOut">
      ${S.trendCache?`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(S.trendCache)}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
          <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.trendCache)">📋 Copy</button>
          <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.trendCache)">📝 Post</button>
        </div>`:`
        <div class="card"><div class="es"><div class="big">🔥</div><div style="font-size:12px">Hit Refresh to generate today's hottest sports storylines and hot takes.</div></div></div>
      `}
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
      <div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:8px">Quick Hot Take</div>
      <div class="ir">
        <input class="inp" id="hotTakeQ" placeholder="Generate a hot take about…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')generateHotTake()">
        <button class="btn bp" onclick="generateHotTake()">🔥</button>
      </div>
      <div id="hotTakeOut"></div>
    </div>`}

async function generateTrending(){
  const out=document.getElementById('trendOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Scanning the sports world…</div>`;
  const sportsList=SP.map(s=>`${s.icon} ${s.name}`).join(', ');
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:`Trending topics engine. Generate today's TOP 10 hottest storylines across all major sports (${sportsList}). For each:\n\n1. A punchy headline\n2. One-sentence context\n3. Hot take angle for commentators\n\nRank by how much buzz they'd generate. Be bold, be current (${new Date().toLocaleDateString()}), and give commentators something to work with.\n\nEnd with: 🔥 HOTTEST TAKE OF THE DAY — your single most provocative but defensible sports opinion right now.`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{S.trendCache=text;if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      S.trendCache=r.text;
    }catch(e){S.trendCache=`Error: ${e.message}`;}
  }else{S.trendCache='⚠️ AI offline.\n— FMFO Sports';}
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(S.trendCache)}</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
      <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.trendCache)">📋 Copy</button>
      <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.trendCache)">📝 Post</button>
    </div>`;
  S.history.push({query:'Trending Topics',sport:'multi',mode:'Trending',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:S.trendCache});
  renderSide();
}

async function generateHotTake(){
  const inp=document.getElementById('hotTakeQ');
  const topic=inp?.value?.trim();if(!topic)return;
  const out=document.getElementById('hotTakeOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Cooking up a take…</div>`;
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis({query:`Hot take generator. Give me a bold, provocative but defensible hot take about: ${topic}\n\nFormat:\n🔥 THE TAKE: [one bold sentence]\n\nWHY IT'S RIGHT: [2-3 supporting points]\nWHY IT'S WRONG: [the strongest counterargument]\nCONFIDENCE: [%]\n\n📌 COMMENTATOR USE: How to bring this up on air without getting fired.`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      S.output=r.text;
      if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(r.text)}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
          <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.output)">📋</button>
          <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.output)">📝</button>
        </div>`;
    }catch(e){if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div style="color:var(--red);font-size:12px">${e.message}</div>`;}
  }
  S.history.push({query:`Hot Take: ${topic}`,sport:'multi',mode:'Trending',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:S.output});
  renderSide();
}

// ============ PREP SHEET ============
function renderPrep(){
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  return `
    <div class="ct" style="font-size:18px">📋 Commentator Prep Sheet</div>
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px">Your pre-broadcast preparation hub. Generate a full prep package or build your own notes.</div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="tab-row">${SP.map(s=>`<button class="chip ${S.sport===s.id?'on':''}" onclick="S.sport='${s.id}';render()">${s.icon}</button>`).join('')}</div>
      <div class="ir">
        <input class="inp" id="prepGame" placeholder="Enter matchup — e.g. Chiefs vs Bills, Arsenal vs Liverpool…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')generatePrep()">
        <button class="btn bp" onclick="generatePrep()">📋 Generate Prep</button>
      </div>
      <div id="prepOut"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ch"><div class="ct">📝 Personal Notes</div>
        <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="saveNotes()">💾 Save</button>
      </div>
      <textarea class="note-area" id="notesArea" placeholder="Your personal notes, talking points, research, reminders…&#10;&#10;This is your scratchpad for broadcast prep.">${S.prepNotes}</textarea>
    </div>
    ${S.saved.filter(a=>a.sport===S.sport).length?`
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ct" style="margin-bottom:8px">Your ${sp?.name} Analyses</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
        ${S.saved.filter(a=>a.sport===S.sport).slice(-5).reverse().map((a,i)=>`
          <div class="fi" onclick="loadSaved2(${S.saved.indexOf(a)})" style="padding:6px">
            <div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><div class="hq">${esc(a.query)}</div></div>
          </div>`).join('')}
      </div>
    </div>`:''}`}

async function generatePrep(){
  const inp=document.getElementById('prepGame');
  const matchup=inp?.value?.trim();if(!matchup)return;
  const sp=SP.find(s=>s.id===S.sport);
  const out=document.getElementById('prepOut');
  if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="thk"><div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div> Building prep sheet…</div>`;
  if(aiReady){
    try{
      const r=await FMFO.streamAnalysis(`FMFO Sports AI — Commentator Prep Sheet Generator.\n\nGenerate a complete broadcast prep sheet for: ${matchup} (${sp.name})\n\nInclude these sections:\n\n📊 KEY STATS TO HAVE READY\n(5-7 stats a commentator should have at their fingertips)\n\n📖 STORYLINES\n(3-4 narrative angles to weave into commentary)\n\n🔑 MATCHUPS TO WATCH\n(2-3 specific player/unit matchups that will decide the game)\n\n🎤 TALKING POINTS\n(5 ready-to-use on-air observations — complete sentences a commentator can say verbatim)\n\n⚠️ WATCH FOR\n(2-3 in-game situations to call out if they happen)\n\n🔮 BOLD PREDICTION\n(one specific, brave prediction with reasoning)\n\nFormat each section clearly. This is a working document a commentator prints and brings to the booth.`},sport:S.sport,mode:'Pre-Game Intel'},(text)=>{if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(text)}</div>`}});
      S.output=r.text;
      if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out" style="font-size:12px">${esc(r.text)}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px">
          <button class="btn bp bsm" onclick="copyText(S.output)">📋 Copy Full Sheet</button>
          <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="saveGameAnalysis('Prep: ${matchup.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')">💾 Save</button>
          <button class="btn bs bsm" onclick="shareAsContent(S.output)">📝 Post</button>
        </div>`;
    }catch(e){if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div style="color:var(--red);font-size:12px">${e.message}</div>`;}
  }else{if(out)out.innerHTML=`<div class="out empty">AI offline — server offline — try again.</div>`;}
  S.history.push({query:`Prep: ${matchup}`,sport:S.sport,mode:'Prep Sheet',time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),output:S.output});
  renderSide();
}

function saveNotes(){
  const area=document.getElementById('notesArea');
  S.prepNotes=area?.value||'';
  if(dbReady&&db){dbSave('notes',{sport:S.sport,notes:S.prepNotes,savedAt:new Date().toISOString()});}
  const b=event?.target;if(b){b.textContent='✓ Saved';setTimeout(()=>b.textContent='💾 Save',1200);}
}

function esc(s){return String(s||'').replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/\n/g,'<br>')}
boot();
</script>
</body>
</html>
